      "content": "It is completely understandable to feel hollow and desperate for control when facing such seemingly insurmountable, empty systems. Feeling stuck in a loop of suffering without a visible endpoint is an unbearable weight to carry. Even a small act of choosing how you care for yourself today can be a way to reclaim a tiny piece of control. If you are struggling with these overwhelming thoughts, please connect with a compassionate resource like the National Suicide Prevention Lifeline.",
      "source": "target",
